{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017jRnboqGJQDYMAQvRu11cc","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"sica_expanded_14b\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"PW D5 600题 + FOLIO 204题 = 804题, K=12, T=0.7, Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct 全规模评估\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"n_total\": 804,\n7\t      \"n_folio\": 204,\n8\t      \"n_proofwriter\": 600,\n9\t      \"folio_sica_accuracy\": 0.794,\n10\t      \"folio_sc_accuracy\": 0.755,\n11\t      \"folio_gap_pp\": 3.9,\n12\t      \"folio_bootstrap_p\": 0.038,\n13\t      \"folio_c0\": 0.48,\n14\t      \"proofwriter_sica_accuracy\": 0.718,\n15\t      \"proofwriter_sc_accuracy\": 0.715,\n16\t      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 0.3,\n17\t      \"proofwriter_bootstrap_p\": 0.41,\n18\t      \"proofwriter_c0\": 0.38,\n19\t      \"combined_sica_accuracy\": 0.737,\n20\t      \"combined_sc_accuracy\": 0.725,\n21\t      \"combined_gap_pp\": 1.2,\n22\t      \"combined_bootstrap_p\": 0.089,\n23\t      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.41,\n24\t      \"c1_extraction_rate\": 0.97,\n25\t      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.031,\n26\t      \"total_constraints_unique\": 58200,\n27\t      \"tiebreak_problems\": 47,\n28\t      \"tiebreak_sica_win_rate\": 0.68,\n29\t      \"wall_time_hours\": 12.5\n30\t    },\n31\t    \"tables\": [\n32\t      \"T1: FOLIO 79.4% vs 75.5% (+3.9pp, p=0.038*), PW 71.8% vs 71.5% (+0.3pp, p=0.41), Combined 73.7% vs 72.5% (+1.2pp, p=0.089)\",\n33\t      \"T2: 47 ties — SICA win 32, SC win 15, win rate 68.1%\"\n34\t    ],\n35\t    \"figures\": [],\n36\t    \"analysis\": \"FOLIO 单独显著（p=0.038）是 Claim 1 的核心支撑，但 combined p=0.089 超过 0.05 阈值。论文策略：不 claim blanket improvement，而是 domain-conditional 呈现——'SICA improves accuracy in domains where formal logical structure aligns with the method's constraint extraction capability'。PW null 结果解释为 answer space 受限导致 tie 稀少。这直接驱动 pivot 到 operating regime 叙事。\\n\\nD012 的 FOLIO +6.7pp 基于 30 题，扩展到 204 题后因回归均值效应缩至 +3.9pp——D012 可能过采样了 high-C0 的 '难题'，204 题中约 52% 的 FOLIO 题 C0=0（模型已达共识），这些题 SICA≡SC，拉低整体 gap。PW 600 题近乎 null（+0.3pp）：PW 三分类答案空间 {True, False, Unknown} 使 K=12 投票几乎总有 clear majority，tie 率极低（<5%），SICA 无 tiebreaking 机会。合并后 PW 的 75% 权重（600/804）稀释 FOLIO 正向信号，combined gap 降至 1.2pp，p=0.089 位于 marginal zone。C0=0.41 略低于 D016 precheck 的 0.46——precheck 的 26 题偏难，扩展后纳入更多简单题拉低多样性。提取率 0.97 反映约 3% 的 PW 长 trace 超出 token 限制导致 extraction 失败。\"\n37\t  },\n38\t  {\n39\t    \"name\": \"sica_k_ablation_14b\",\n40\t    \"description\": \"K=6,8,12,16,20 在 D012 60 题上的灵敏度分析，Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n41\t    \"results\": {\n42\t      \"k6_sica_acc\": 0.717,\n43\t      \"k6_sc_acc\": 0.683,\n44\t      \"k6_gap_pp\": 3.4,\n45\t      \"k6_c0\": 0.55,\n46\t      \"k6_tie_rate\": 0.28,\n47\t      \"k8_sica_acc\": 0.733,\n48\t      \"k8_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n49\t      \"k8_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n50\t      \"k8_c0\": 0.52,\n51\t      \"k8_tie_rate\": 0.22,\n52\t      \"k12_sica_acc\": 0.733,\n53\t      \"k12_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n54\t      \"k12_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n55\t      \"k12_c0\": 0.53,\n56\t      \"k12_tie_rate\": 0.17,\n57\t      \"k16_sica_acc\": 0.717,\n58\t      \"k16_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n59\t      \"k16_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n60\t      \"k16_c0\": 0.45,\n61\t      \"k16_tie_rate\": 0.12,\n62\t      \"k20_sica_acc\": 0.717,\n63\t      \"k20_sc_acc\": 0.71,\n64\t      \"k20_gap_pp\": 0.7,\n65\t      \"k20_c0\": 0.4,\n66\t      \"k20_tie_rate\": 0.08\n67\t    },\n68\t    \"tables\": [\n69\t      \"T3: K | SICA% | SC% | Gap(pp) | C0 | Tie Rate — 5 行，展示 gap-tie_rate 正相关\"\n70\t    ],\n71\t    \"figures\": [],\n72\t    \"analysis\": \"K sensitivity 证明 SICA 优势与 tie 频率系统性共变（非 K 的偶然产物），验证 principled tiebreaking 叙事。K=12 选择有充分依据：accuracy 与 gap 的最佳平衡点。论文中用 F4 作为 Claim 1 的 mechanistic evidence。\\n\\nK 增大时两个机制同时作用：(1) SC 多数票更稳定（tie 率从 K=6 的 28% 降至 K=20 的 8%），SICA tiebreaking 机会减少；(2) 更多 trace 提供更多 constraint 但也引入更多噪声，边际信息增益递减。K=6 tie 率最高（偶数 K 天然更多 tie，且 6 票分布方差大），C0=0.55 也最高（6 条 trace 的采样方差大），但绝对 accuracy 略低于 K=12（样本太少 constraint 覆盖不足）。K=12 是 sweet spot——足够的 trace 保证 constraint 质量，tie 率仍可观（17%）。K=16/20 时 SC 趋于自足——更多投票使多数规则本身变强，SICA 的 marginal value 递减至 <2pp。Gap 与 tie rate 的正相关直接支撑 'SICA 本质是 principled tiebreaker' 的定位。\"\n73\t  },\n74\t  {\n75\t    \"name\": \"tiebreak_baseline_analysis\",\n76\t    \"description\": \"在 exp-001 扩展数据 804 题上重新对比 SICA vs SC-random vs SC-alphabetical vs SC-first-seen tiebreak\",\n77\t    \"results\": {\n78\t      \"n_ties\": 47,\n79\t      \"sica_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.681,\n80\t      \"sc_random_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.489,\n81\t      \"sc_alphabetical_accuracy\": 0.532,\n82\t      \"sc_first_seen_accuracy\": 0.447,\n83\t      \"sica_vs_random_binomial_p\": 0.031,\n84\t      \"sica_win_rate_vs_random\": 0.68\n85\t    },\n86\t    \"tables\": [\n87\t      \"T2: SICA 68.1% vs Random 48.9% vs Alphabetical 53.2% vs First-seen 44.7%, n=47, p(SICA>Random)=0.031\"\n88\t    ],\n89\t    \"figures\": [],\n90\t    \"analysis\": \"Tiebreak win rate 0.68 在 median 档范围内且统计显著（p=0.031）。这是 Claim 1 最直接的证据——在 tie 发生时 SICA 的 principled resolution 系统性优于任意规则。论文中应以 tiebreak analysis 而非 overall accuracy 作为 Claim 1 的核心论据。\\n\\nD012 的 5 个 tie 扩展到 47 个后，SICA win rate 从 80%（4/5）回落到 68%（32/47）——小样本的 upward bias 被校正。SC-random 在 47 次 tie 上接近理论 50%（实际 48.9%），符合 binomial 预期。SICA 仍系统性优于所有 baseline：MaxSAT constraint weighting 在 tie 时利用了 trace 内的逻辑结构信息来区分候选答案，而 SC 的 tiebreak 规则完全忽略 trace 内容。68% 而非更高，因为扩展数据中部分 tie 的 constraint extraction 质量差（尤其 PW 的 FOL 翻译在 ambiguous 题目上会出错），导致 MaxSAT 也选错。47 个 tie 上的 binomial test p=0.031 显著。\"\n91\t  },\n92\t  {\n93\t    \"name\": \"sica_7b_scaling\",\n94\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 在 D012 60 题上，验证 weaker model → higher C0 → larger gap\",\n95\t    \"results\": {\n96\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.65,\n97\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.617,\n98\t      \"gap_pp\": 3.3,\n99\t      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.65,\n100\t      \"folio_sica\": 0.733,\n101\t      \"folio_sc\": 0.667,\n102\t      \"folio_gap_pp\": 6.6,\n103\t      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.583,\n104\t      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.583,\n105\t      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n106\t      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.19,\n107\t      \"c1_extraction_rate\": 0.92,\n108\t      \"wall_time_hours\": 1.8\n109\t    },\n110\t    \"tables\": [\n111\t      \"T1 Qwen-7B 行: 65.0% vs 61.7%, +3.3pp, C0=0.65\"\n112\t    ],\n113\t    \"figures\": [],\n114\t    \"analysis\": \"7B 确立了 C0 gradient 的关键一环：7B(0.65) >> 14B(0.53)。但 gap(3.3pp) 与 14B(3.3pp) 持平而非更大——因为 7B 的 constraint extraction 质量较低（rate=0.92），抵消了部分高 C0 带来的 tiebreaking 机会。这提示 C0 是必要条件但非充分条件：还需要足够的 constraint quality。\\n\\n7B 基线更弱（SC 61.7% vs 14B 的 70%），模型在 NLI 推理上不够自信，输出多样性显著更高（C0=0.65 vs 14B 的 0.53）。更多题目有 multi-candidate（65% vs 53%），更多 tie 发生，SICA 有更多 tiebreaking 机会。FOLIO 上 gap 达 6.6pp——7B 在 FOLIO 上频繁犹豫于不同答案，SICA 的 constraint weighting 帮助选出正确的。PW 上仍然 0pp——三分类答案空间的 structural constraint 不变，即使 7B 也能在 PW 上形成 clear majority。Combined gap 3.3pp 但 p=0.19（60 题不足以达显著）。Extraction rate 0.92 低于 14B（1.0），因为 7B 的推理 trace 格式不够规范，约 8% 的 trace 无法提取有效 FOL。C0=0.65 >> 14B 的 0.53，明确支撑 gradient 的前半段。\"\n115\t  },\n116\t  {\n117\t    \"name\": \"qwq_32b_operating_regime\",\n118\t    \"description\": \"QwQ-32B 已有 MVP 数据的 operating regime 格式化，无新 GPU\",\n119\t    \"results\": {\n120\t      \"c0_combined\": 0.036,\n121\t      \"c0_aime\": 0.0,\n122\t      \"c0_folio\": 0.0,\n123\t      \"c0_proofwriter\": 0.1875,\n124\t      \"sica_sc_gap_all_domains\": 0.0,\n125\t      \"n_aime\": 22,\n126\t      \"n_folio\": 10,\n127\t      \"n_proofwriter\": 16,\n128\t      \"n_total\": 48,\n129\t      \"regime_label\": \"degenerate (C0<5%)\"\n130\t    },\n131\t    \"tables\": [\n132\t      \"T1 QwQ-32B 行: AIME/FOLIO/PW 全部 SICA≡SC, C0=3.6%\"\n133\t    ],\n134\t    \"figures\": [],\n135\t    \"analysis\": \"QwQ-32B 是 negative control——论文将其呈现为 'When Does Symbolic Consensus Degenerate?'。核心 insight：reasoning model 的确定性使 symbolic consensus 冗余。这是 Claim 2 的半壁江山——C0<5% → SICA 无效，与 instruction model 的 C0>30% → SICA 有效形成对比。\\n\\n直接复用 MVP 阶段数据。QwQ-32B 的 extended chain-of-thought 使 reasoning chain 高度确定——即使在 T=0.7 下，thinking tokens 的序列长度和 internal consistency 压制了采样随机性，导致 K=12 条 trace 几乎总是收敛到同一答案。AIME/FOLIO 上 C0=0%（完全 unanimity），PW 上 18.75%（仅因三分类下偶尔在 True/Unknown 间犹豫）。SICA≡SC 是 structural 结果：无 tie 则无 tiebreaking 机会，MaxSAT 选择与 majority vote 完全一致。\"\n136\t  },\n137\t  {\n138\t    \"name\": \"c0_diagnostic_validation\",\n139\t    \"description\": \"跨所有模型和 K 值的 C0 vs SICA-SC gap CPU 分析\",\n140\t    \"results\": {\n141\t      \"total_data_points\": 14,\n142\t      \"c0_range_observed\": [\n143\t        0.0,\n144\t        0.65\n145\t      ],\n146\t      \"gap_range_observed\": [\n147\t        -1.7,\n148\t        6.6\n149\t      ],\n150\t      \"pearson_r\": 0.72,\n151\t      \"spearman_rho\": 0.78,\n152\t      \"c0_below_5pct_all_gap_zero\": true,\n153\t      \"c0_above_20pct_positive_gap_rate\": 0.727,\n154\t      \"binary_accuracy_20pct_threshold\": 0.86,\n155\t      \"n_anomalous_points\": 2,\n156\t      \"anomaly_1\": \"Mistral-7B: C0=0.35, gap=-1.7pp (low extraction quality)\",\n157\t      \"anomaly_2\": \"PW-expanded-14B: C0=0.38, gap=0.3pp (restricted answer space)\"\n158\t    },\n159\t    \"tables\": [\n160\t      \"T_diagnostic: Model × Dataset × C0 × Gap × Binary Prediction × Actual，14 行汇总\"\n161\t    ],\n162\t    \"figures\": [],\n163\t    \"analysis\": \"C0 作为 binary diagnostic 在 median 档下成立（86% accuracy），但 r=0.72 不支持 continuous predictor claim。Claim 3 必须降级：'C0 serves as a binary indicator (high/low) for SICA deployment viability, rather than a continuous predictor of expected gain.' Hero figure F2 是论文最重要的图——它一眼传达 operating regime 的核心论点。\\n\\n14 个数据点来自 7 个模型配置 × 2 个主要 dataset 的组合（加上 K ablation 和 GSM8K 的少量额外点）。Pearson r=0.72 表明中等强度正相关但非完美线性——C0 是 gap 的必要非充分条件。C0<5% 的 3 个点（QwQ-32B 全域 + DeepSeek-R1 全域）全部 gap=0，验证了下界。C0>20% 的 11 个点中 8 个有正 gap，但 Mistral-7B（constraint quality 差）和 PW-expanded（answer space 受限）是异常值。Binary classification 以 C0=20% 为阈值达 86% 准确率（12/14），但这基于 14 个点——论文不应 overclaim。\"\n164\t  },\n165\t  {\n166\t    \"name\": \"sica_72b_awq\",\n167\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit 在 D012 60 题上\",\n168\t    \"results\": {\n169\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.767,\n170\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.75,\n171\t      \"gap_pp\": 1.7,\n172\t      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.4,\n173\t      \"folio_sica\": 0.833,\n174\t      \"folio_sc\": 0.8,\n175\t      \"folio_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n176\t      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.717,\n177\t      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.717,\n178\t      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n179\t      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.31,\n180\t      \"wall_time_hours\": 3.5\n181\t    },\n182\t    \"tables\": [\n183\t      \"T1 Qwen-72B 行: 76.7% vs 75.0%, +1.7pp, C0=0.40\"\n184\t    ],\n185\t    \"figures\": [],\n186\t    \"analysis\": \"72B 部分支撑 within-family scaling，但 gradient noise 限制了 Claim 3 的连续预测叙事。14B→72B 仅 13pp C0 drop 而 gap 从 3.3→1.7pp，暗示 C0-gap 关系在高 baseline 区域变弱。论文中需提及 AWQ 量化 confound。将 scaling 结果定位为 'directionally consistent' 而非 'smooth gradient'。\\n\\n72B SC baseline 更高（75% vs 14B 的 70%），反映更强模型在 NLI 上更准确。C0=0.40 与 14B 的 0.53 差异存在但不够大——这是 median 档核心特征 '72B not clearly lower than 14B'。原因：(1) 4-bit AWQ 量化引入精度损失，增加了输出随机性（部分抵消了 72B 的确定性优势）；(2) FOLIO/PW 对 72B 仍有足够挑战性（不像 GSM8K 被碾压）。Gap 缩至 1.7pp 因为高 baseline 意味着 tie 中 SC 已更常选对——SICA 的 marginal correction 空间更小。FOLIO 仍有 +3.3pp，PW 仍 0pp，pattern 不变。p=0.31 远不显著（60 题）。C0 gradient 变 noisy：7B(0.65) >> 14B(0.53) > 72B(0.40)，14B→72B 仅 drop 13pp，不是 clean monotonic decrease。\"\n187\t  },\n188\t  {\n189\t    \"name\": \"constraint_quality_case_studies\",\n190\t    \"description\": \"8 道代表性题目的 constraint 提取质量定性分析\",\n191\t    \"results\": {\n192\t      \"n_cases\": 8,\n193\t      \"case_selection\": \"SICA-flip-correct × 2, SICA-maintain-correct × 2, SICA-flip-wrong × 2, SICA-maintain-wrong × 2\",\n194\t      \"constraint_semantic_accuracy\": 0.75,\n195\t      \"categories\": {\n196\t        \"correct_and_meaningful\": 4,\n197\t        \"partially_correct\": 2,\n198\t        \"noisy_but_harmless\": 1,\n199\t        \"misleading\": 1\n200\t      },\n201\t      \"exclusion_justified_rate\": 0.83,\n202\t      \"key_pattern\": \"FOLIO constraints map to premise FOL with ~80% fidelity; PW constraints degrade on multi-hop chains where intermediate steps are lossy\"\n203\t    },\n204\t    \"tables\": [],\n205\t    \"figures\": [],\n206\t    \"analysis\": \"定性分析支撑 interpretability 叙事——SICA 可以展示 why（通过 constraint 权重和 exclusion），这是 SC 做不到的。但 25% 的 constraint quality issue 需在 limitations 讨论。misleading case 直接解释了为什么 tiebreak win rate 是 68% 而非 100%。\\n\\n选取 8 道覆盖 4 种 SICA 结果类型的题目做定性分析。约 75% 的 constraint 正确捕获了前提-结论关系——FOLIO 的 FOL 翻译质量较好（问题本身就是 FOL reasoning），PW 在多跳推理链上 intermediate step 的 FOL 翻译有信息损失。4 道题 constraint 完全正确且语义 meaningful（SICA flip-correct 的典型案例：多数 trace 的 constraint 一致指向正确答案，MaxSAT satisfied 它们）。2 道部分正确（关键 constraint 在但有冗余噪声 constraint）。1 道噪声但无害（constraint 全是 trivial tautology，MaxSAT 退化为 vote count）。1 道 misleading——量词范围歧义导致错误 FOL，MaxSAT 基于错误 constraint 选了错答案（SICA flip-wrong 的典型案例）。\"\n207\t  },\n208\t  {\n209\t    \"name\": \"overhead_analysis\",\n210\t    \"description\": \"exp-001 数据的 per-question wall-time 分解\",\n211\t    \"results\": {\n212\t      \"avg_total_per_question_s\": 56.0,\n213\t      \"avg_generation_s\": 48.0,\n214\t      \"avg_constraint_extraction_s\": 5.2,\n215\t      \"avg_maxsat_solving_s\": 0.8,\n216\t      \"avg_postprocessing_s\": 2.0,\n217\t      \"generation_pct\": 85.7,\n218\t      \"extraction_pct\": 9.3,\n219\t      \"maxsat_pct\": 1.4,\n220\t      \"postprocessing_pct\": 3.6,\n221\t      \"overhead_vs_sc_pct\": 14.3,\n222\t      \"overhead_vs_sc_absolute_s\": 8.0,\n223\t      \"sc_equivalent_time_s\": 48.0\n224\t    },\n225\t    \"tables\": [\n226\t      \"T4: Stage | Time(s) | % Total — Generation 48.0(85.7%), Extraction 5.2(9.3%), MaxSAT 0.8(1.4%), Post 2.0(3.6%)\"\n227\t    ],\n228\t    \"figures\": [],\n229\t    \"analysis\": \"14% overhead 是卖点而非弱点。论文强调 'SICA adds <15% wall-time overhead to SC while providing principled tiebreaking and post-hoc constraint interpretability'。MaxSAT <1s 也反驳 over-engineering 的运行时担忧（虽然 exp-013 的 accuracy 消融可能支持简化）。\\n\\nLLM 生成（K=12 条 trace）占 86% 的时间——这部分 SICA 与 SC 完全共享，不是额外开销。Constraint extraction 需要一次额外的 LLM call（~5.2s），这是 SICA 的主要 overhead 来源。MaxSAT 在这些小规模问题（每题 ~50 个 unique constraint）上 Z3 求解极快（<1s）。总 overhead 14.3%（8s/question），全部来自 extraction + postprocessing。由于 K 次生成已经是 SC 的必要成本，SICA 的增量成本可控。对 EMNLP reviewer 的说服力：14% overhead 换取在 tie 场景下 68% vs 49% 的选择准确率，且提供 interpretable constraint analysis。\"\n230\t  },\n231\t  {\n232\t    \"name\": \"sica_mistral_7b\",\n233\t    \"description\": \"Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 在 D012 60 题上的跨家族验证\",\n234\t    \"results\": {\n235\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.583,\n236\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.6,\n237\t      \"gap_pp\": -1.7,\n238\t      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.35,\n239\t      \"folio_sica\": 0.6,\n240\t      \"folio_sc\": 0.633,\n241\t      \"folio_gap_pp\": -3.3,\n242\t      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.567,\n243\t      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.567,\n244\t      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n245\t      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.72,\n246\t      \"c1_extraction_rate\": 0.85,\n247\t      \"wall_time_hours\": 1.2\n248\t    },\n249\t    \"tables\": [\n250\t      \"T1 Mistral-7B 行: 58.3% vs 60.0%, -1.7pp, C0=0.35\"\n251\t    ],\n252\t    \"figures\": [],\n253\t    \"analysis\": \"Mistral 的负 gap 暴露了 SICA 的隐含前提：constraint extraction quality 必须足够高。C0 是 necessary but not sufficient——高 C0 + 低 extraction quality = 负 gap。论文中将此作为 'second operating condition' 讨论：SICA 有效需要 (1) C0>20% AND (2) constraint extraction fidelity sufficient。这实际上深化了 operating regime 分析而非削弱——增加了一个维度。3-family 结果：2/3 positive (Qwen+LLaMA), 1/3 anomalous (Mistral, with identified mechanism)。\\n\\nMistral-7B 是 median 档中 'one cross-family model shows anomalous C0 or negative gap' 的体现。C0=0.35 中等（在 [0.2, 0.45] 范围内），说明 Mistral 确实有 trace diversity，按 C0 预测应有正 gap——但实际 gap 为负。根本原因：Mistral 的 instruction following 风格与 SICA 的 FOL extraction prompt 不匹配，extraction rate 仅 0.85（15% trace 提取失败）。更关键的是，成功提取的 constraint 中有相当比例存在语义错误——Mistral 的 reasoning trace 格式较 free-form，FOL 翻译的 fidelity 低于 Qwen/LLaMA。结果：噪声 constraint 误导 MaxSAT 权重分配，在 FOLIO 上 SICA 翻转了 2 道原本 SC 选对的题但只纠正了 1 道（净亏损）。PW 上 constraint 噪声被三分类的 clear majority 压制，gap=0。整体 -1.7pp 不显著（p=0.72），不能说 SICA 有害，但也不能说有益。\"\n254\t  },\n255\t  {\n256\t    \"name\": \"sica_llama_8b\",\n257\t    \"description\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct 在 D012 60 题上的跨家族验证\",\n258\t    \"results\": {\n259\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.617,\n260\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.6,\n261\t      \"gap_pp\": 1.7,\n262\t      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.43,\n263\t      \"folio_sica\": 0.667,\n264\t      \"folio_sc\": 0.633,\n265\t      \"folio_gap_pp\": 3.4,\n266\t      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.567,\n267\t      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.567,\n268\t      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n269\t      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.29,\n270\t      \"c1_extraction_rate\": 0.94,\n271\t      \"wall_time_hours\": 1.3\n272\t    },\n273\t    \"tables\": [\n274\t      \"T1 LLaMA-8B 行: 61.7% vs 60.0%, +1.7pp, C0=0.43\"\n275\t    ],\n276\t    \"figures\": [],\n277\t    \"analysis\": \"LLaMA 成功复制 Qwen 的 FOLIO-positive / PW-neutral pattern，消除 Qwen-specific artifact 的攻击。与 Mistral 的对比是论文的 natural experiment——控制了 model size，变化了 extraction quality，揭示 SICA 的第二个 operating condition。3-family validation: Qwen(+3.3pp) + LLaMA(+1.7pp) positive, Mistral(-1.7pp) anomalous with identified cause。\\n\\nLLaMA-3.1-8B 是 '2/3 cross-family models show expected C0 pattern' 的正面案例。C0=0.43 在 [0.2, 0.45] 范围内上段，LLaMA 8B 的 instruction following 产生中等 trace diversity。Extraction rate 0.94 接近 Qwen 水平——LLaMA 的 chat template 与 SICA extraction prompt 兼容性好（比 Mistral 好得多）。FOLIO 上 +3.4pp（1 道题的 flip），pattern 与 Qwen-14B 一致：formal logic domain + 足够 C0 + 好的 extraction quality = 正向 gap。PW 仍然 0pp（与所有 instruction model 一致）。Combined +1.7pp 在 cross_family_gap_pp [0.0, 3.0] 范围内。p=0.29 在 60 题上不显著，但方向性一致。与 Mistral 的关键对比：相似 size (7B vs 8B)，相似 C0 (0.35 vs 0.43)，截然不同的 gap (-1.7 vs +1.7)——差异在 extraction rate (0.85 vs 0.94)。\"\n278\t  },\n279\t  {\n280\t    \"name\": \"gsm8k_pilot_14b\",\n281\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B 在 GSM8K 30 题 pilot, K=12\",\n282\t    \"results\": {\n283\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.9,\n284\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.9,\n285\t      \"gap_pp\": 0.0,\n286\t      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.1,\n287\t      \"n_questions\": 30,\n288\t      \"n_ties\": 1,\n289\t      \"constraint_extraction_note\": \"~60% constraints are trivial arithmetic identities (e.g., x=5→x=5)\",\n290\t      \"wall_time_hours\": 0.8\n291\t    },\n292\t    \"tables\": [\n293\t      \"Appendix T_gsm8k: 90% vs 90%, C0=10%, gap=0pp\"\n294\t    ],\n295\t    \"figures\": [],\n296\t    \"analysis\": \"GSM8K null result 是 publishable insight：同一模型 14B 在 FOLIO(C0=0.48) 上 SICA 有效，在 GSM8K(C0=0.10) 上退化，证明 C0 反映 task-relative difficulty 而非 model identity。放 appendix 作 cross-domain 验证。\\n\\n14B 在 GSM8K 上极强（SC 90%），C0 仅 10%（30 题中 3 题有多候选）。GSM8K 的 grade-school 数学对 14B 是已解决任务——模型 high confidence 导致 K=12 条 trace 几乎总收敛到同一数值答案。仅 1 个 tie（3 个 multi-candidate 题中恰好 1 个 vote count 打平），SICA 无实质 tiebreaking 机会。额外挑战：数学推理的 constraint 提取语义贫乏——算术步骤 '3+4=7' 翻译为 FOL 后多是 trivial identity，无法为 MaxSAT 提供有区分力的信息。Gap=0pp 是 structural 结果。与 FOLIO(C0=0.48) 的对比说明同一模型在不同 task 上展现不同 C0——C0 是 task-relative model confidence 的反映，非 model family 固有属性。\"\n297\t  },\n298\t  {\n299\t    \"name\": \"constraint_ablation\",\n300\t    \"description\": \"CPU-only 消融: SICA-MaxSAT vs SICA-count-only vs SICA-random-weight 在 exp-001 的 804 题上\",\n301\t    \"results\": {\n302\t      \"n_questions\": 804,\n303\t      \"maxsat_accuracy\": 0.737,\n304\t      \"count_only_accuracy\": 0.73,\n305\t      \"random_weight_accuracy\": 0.72,\n306\t      \"maxsat_vs_count_gap_pp\": 0.7,\n307\t      \"maxsat_vs_random_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n308\t      \"count_vs_random_gap_pp\": 1.0,\n309\t      \"maxsat_vs_count_bootstrap_p\": 0.33,\n310\t      \"maxsat_vs_random_bootstrap_p\": 0.09,\n311\t      \"tie_only_maxsat\": 0.681,\n312\t      \"tie_only_count\": 0.638,\n313\t      \"tie_only_random\": 0.489\n314\t    },\n315\t    \"tables\": [\n316\t      \"Appendix T_ablation: Method × Overall Acc × Tie-only Acc，3 行\"\n317\t    ],\n318\t    \"figures\": [],\n319\t    \"analysis\": \"消融结果迫使叙事调整。两种可选路径：(A) 'MaxSAT adds marginal accuracy but provides interpretability framework' (B) 'weighted counting suffices for accuracy; MaxSAT is the formal foundation enabling constraint-level analysis'。Median 档下选 (B)——不 overclaim MaxSAT 的 accuracy 优势，强调其作为 formal framework 的价值（constraint satisfaction/violation 的可解释性是 SC/count-only 无法提供的）。\\n\\nMedian 档定义 'MaxSAT ≥ count-only but difference small (<2pp)'。Overall：MaxSAT 73.7% vs count-only 73.0%，差 0.7pp（p=0.33 不显著）。大多数题上 MaxSAT 和 count-only 选同一答案——因为拥有更多 constraint 的答案通常也是 MaxSAT satisfiability 最高的。差异集中在 constraint 间有冲突的少数题：MaxSAT 通过 partial satisfaction 权衡冲突 constraint，而 count-only 简单加总忽略冲突。Tie-only 场景差异更大（68.1% vs 63.8%），因为 tie 正是 constraint 冲突最可能出现的地方。Random-weight 作为下界（72.0% overall, 48.9% tie-only）证明 constraint 信息本身有价值——不是随便加权就行。但 MaxSAT vs count-only 的不显著差距意味着论文不能 claim 'satisfiability checking is essential for accuracy'。\"\n320\t  },\n321\t  {\n322\t    \"name\": \"sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\",\n323\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-LLaMA-8B 在 D012 60 题上验证第二个 reasoning architecture\",\n324\t    \"results\": {\n325\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.683,\n326\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.683,\n327\t      \"gap_pp\": 0.0,\n328\t      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.05,\n329\t      \"folio_sica\": 0.733,\n330\t      \"folio_sc\": 0.733,\n331\t      \"folio_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n332\t      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.65,\n333\t      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.65,\n334\t      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n335\t      \"wall_time_hours\": 1.8\n336\t    },\n337\t    \"tables\": [\n338\t      \"T1 DeepSeek-R1 行: 68.3% vs 68.3%, 0pp, C0=5%\"\n339\t    ],\n340\t    \"figures\": [],\n341\t    \"analysis\": \"两个 reasoning model（QwQ-32B Qwen底座 32B + DeepSeek-R1 LLaMA底座 8B）跨架构、跨 size 一致展示 C0<5% 且 SICA≡SC。论文可 confidently generalize：'Reasoning-trained models, regardless of base architecture or scale, exhibit trace determinism that renders symbolic consensus redundant.' 与 instruction model（高 C0）的对比构成 Claim 2 的核心 dichotomy。\\n\\nDeepSeek-R1-Distill 继承了 R1 的 reasoning training，产生 extended thinking chain 压制输出多样性。C0=5%（60 题中仅 3 题有多候选），与 QwQ-32B 的 3.6% 量级一致。虽然参数仅 8B（与 LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct 的 C0=0.43 形成鲜明对比），但 distillation training 使模型 internalize 了 step-by-step reasoning 的确定性路径。注意：R1-Distill 的 SC baseline（68.3%）比同 size 的 LLaMA-3.1-8B instruction model（60.0%）高 8pp——reasoning distillation 提升了基础准确率但消灭了 trace diversity。Gap=0pp 是 structural 的：3 个 multi-candidate 题中无 tie，MaxSAT 与 majority vote 选择一致。这完美复制了 QwQ-32B 的 pattern 但在 LLaMA 底座上——同时消除 'only QwQ' 和 'only Qwen architecture' 两重攻击。\"\n342\t  }\n343\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c5fc2e4-30d4-41fd-873a-e3f8c4060094","uuid":"415326a4-2117-4c69-9e42-ff75fd506419","timestamp":"2026-05-16T16:18:45.350Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T155754/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_expanded_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"PW D5 600题 + FOLIO 204题 = 804题, K=12, T=0.7, Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct 全规模评估\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_total\": 804,\n      \"n_folio\": 204,\n      \"n_proofwriter\": 600,\n      \"folio_sica_accuracy\": 0.794,\n      \"folio_sc_accuracy\": 0.755,\n      \"folio_gap_pp\": 3.9,\n      \"folio_bootstrap_p\": 0.038,\n      \"folio_c0\": 0.48,\n      \"proofwriter_sica_accuracy\": 0.718,\n      \"proofwriter_sc_accuracy\": 0.715,\n      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 0.3,\n      \"proofwriter_bootstrap_p\": 0.41,\n      \"proofwriter_c0\": 0.38,\n      \"combined_sica_accuracy\": 0.737,\n      \"combined_sc_accuracy\": 0.725,\n      \"combined_gap_pp\": 1.2,\n      \"combined_bootstrap_p\": 0.089,\n      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.41,\n      \"c1_extraction_rate\": 0.97,\n      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.031,\n      \"total_constraints_unique\": 58200,\n      \"tiebreak_problems\": 47,\n      \"tiebreak_sica_win_rate\": 0.68,\n      \"wall_time_hours\": 12.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T1: FOLIO 79.4% vs 75.5% (+3.9pp, p=0.038*), PW 71.8% vs 71.5% (+0.3pp, p=0.41), Combined 73.7% vs 72.5% (+1.2pp, p=0.089)\",\n      \"T2: 47 ties — SICA win 32, SC win 15, win rate 68.1%\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"FOLIO 单独显著（p=0.038）是 Claim 1 的核心支撑，但 combined p=0.089 超过 0.05 阈值。论文策略：不 claim blanket improvement，而是 domain-conditional 呈现——'SICA improves accuracy in domains where formal logical structure aligns with the method's constraint extraction capability'。PW null 结果解释为 answer space 受限导致 tie 稀少。这直接驱动 pivot 到 operating regime 叙事。\\n\\nD012 的 FOLIO +6.7pp 基于 30 题，扩展到 204 题后因回归均值效应缩至 +3.9pp——D012 可能过采样了 high-C0 的 '难题'，204 题中约 52% 的 FOLIO 题 C0=0（模型已达共识），这些题 SICA≡SC，拉低整体 gap。PW 600 题近乎 null（+0.3pp）：PW 三分类答案空间 {True, False, Unknown} 使 K=12 投票几乎总有 clear majority，tie 率极低（<5%），SICA 无 tiebreaking 机会。合并后 PW 的 75% 权重（600/804）稀释 FOLIO 正向信号，combined gap 降至 1.2pp，p=0.089 位于 marginal zone。C0=0.41 略低于 D016 precheck 的 0.46——precheck 的 26 题偏难，扩展后纳入更多简单题拉低多样性。提取率 0.97 反映约 3% 的 PW 长 trace 超出 token 限制导致 extraction 失败。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_k_ablation_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"K=6,8,12,16,20 在 D012 60 题上的灵敏度分析，Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k6_sica_acc\": 0.717,\n      \"k6_sc_acc\": 0.683,\n      \"k6_gap_pp\": 3.4,\n      \"k6_c0\": 0.55,\n      \"k6_tie_rate\": 0.28,\n      \"k8_sica_acc\": 0.733,\n      \"k8_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n      \"k8_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"k8_c0\": 0.52,\n      \"k8_tie_rate\": 0.22,\n      \"k12_sica_acc\": 0.733,\n      \"k12_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n      \"k12_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"k12_c0\": 0.53,\n      \"k12_tie_rate\": 0.17,\n      \"k16_sica_acc\": 0.717,\n      \"k16_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n      \"k16_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"k16_c0\": 0.45,\n      \"k16_tie_rate\": 0.12,\n      \"k20_sica_acc\": 0.717,\n      \"k20_sc_acc\": 0.71,\n      \"k20_gap_pp\": 0.7,\n      \"k20_c0\": 0.4,\n      \"k20_tie_rate\": 0.08\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T3: K | SICA% | SC% | Gap(pp) | C0 | Tie Rate — 5 行，展示 gap-tie_rate 正相关\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"K sensitivity 证明 SICA 优势与 tie 频率系统性共变（非 K 的偶然产物），验证 principled tiebreaking 叙事。K=12 选择有充分依据：accuracy 与 gap 的最佳平衡点。论文中用 F4 作为 Claim 1 的 mechanistic evidence。\\n\\nK 增大时两个机制同时作用：(1) SC 多数票更稳定（tie 率从 K=6 的 28% 降至 K=20 的 8%），SICA tiebreaking 机会减少；(2) 更多 trace 提供更多 constraint 但也引入更多噪声，边际信息增益递减。K=6 tie 率最高（偶数 K 天然更多 tie，且 6 票分布方差大），C0=0.55 也最高（6 条 trace 的采样方差大），但绝对 accuracy 略低于 K=12（样本太少 constraint 覆盖不足）。K=12 是 sweet spot——足够的 trace 保证 constraint 质量，tie 率仍可观（17%）。K=16/20 时 SC 趋于自足——更多投票使多数规则本身变强，SICA 的 marginal value 递减至 <2pp。Gap 与 tie rate 的正相关直接支撑 'SICA 本质是 principled tiebreaker' 的定位。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"tiebreak_baseline_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"在 exp-001 扩展数据 804 题上重新对比 SICA vs SC-random vs SC-alphabetical vs SC-first-seen tiebreak\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_ties\": 47,\n      \"sica_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.681,\n      \"sc_random_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.489,\n      \"sc_alphabetical_accuracy\": 0.532,\n      \"sc_first_seen_accuracy\": 0.447,\n      \"sica_vs_random_binomial_p\": 0.031,\n      \"sica_win_rate_vs_random\": 0.68\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T2: SICA 68.1% vs Random 48.9% vs Alphabetical 53.2% vs First-seen 44.7%, n=47, p(SICA>Random)=0.031\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Tiebreak win rate 0.68 在 median 档范围内且统计显著（p=0.031）。这是 Claim 1 最直接的证据——在 tie 发生时 SICA 的 principled resolution 系统性优于任意规则。论文中应以 tiebreak analysis 而非 overall accuracy 作为 Claim 1 的核心论据。\\n\\nD012 的 5 个 tie 扩展到 47 个后，SICA win rate 从 80%（4/5）回落到 68%（32/47）——小样本的 upward bias 被校正。SC-random 在 47 次 tie 上接近理论 50%（实际 48.9%），符合 binomial 预期。SICA 仍系统性优于所有 baseline：MaxSAT constraint weighting 在 tie 时利用了 trace 内的逻辑结构信息来区分候选答案，而 SC 的 tiebreak 规则完全忽略 trace 内容。68% 而非更高，因为扩展数据中部分 tie 的 constraint extraction 质量差（尤其 PW 的 FOL 翻译在 ambiguous 题目上会出错），导致 MaxSAT 也选错。47 个 tie 上的 binomial test p=0.031 显著。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_7b_scaling\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 在 D012 60 题上，验证 weaker model → higher C0 → larger gap\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.65,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.617,\n      \"gap_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.65,\n      \"folio_sica\": 0.733,\n      \"folio_sc\": 0.667,\n      \"folio_gap_pp\": 6.6,\n      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.583,\n      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.583,\n      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.19,\n      \"c1_extraction_rate\": 0.92,\n      \"wall_time_hours\": 1.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T1 Qwen-7B 行: 65.0% vs 61.7%, +3.3pp, C0=0.65\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"7B 确立了 C0 gradient 的关键一环：7B(0.65) >> 14B(0.53)。但 gap(3.3pp) 与 14B(3.3pp) 持平而非更大——因为 7B 的 constraint extraction 质量较低（rate=0.92），抵消了部分高 C0 带来的 tiebreaking 机会。这提示 C0 是必要条件但非充分条件：还需要足够的 constraint quality。\\n\\n7B 基线更弱（SC 61.7% vs 14B 的 70%），模型在 NLI 推理上不够自信，输出多样性显著更高（C0=0.65 vs 14B 的 0.53）。更多题目有 multi-candidate（65% vs 53%），更多 tie 发生，SICA 有更多 tiebreaking 机会。FOLIO 上 gap 达 6.6pp——7B 在 FOLIO 上频繁犹豫于不同答案，SICA 的 constraint weighting 帮助选出正确的。PW 上仍然 0pp——三分类答案空间的 structural constraint 不变，即使 7B 也能在 PW 上形成 clear majority。Combined gap 3.3pp 但 p=0.19（60 题不足以达显著）。Extraction rate 0.92 低于 14B（1.0），因为 7B 的推理 trace 格式不够规范，约 8% 的 trace 无法提取有效 FOL。C0=0.65 >> 14B 的 0.53，明确支撑 gradient 的前半段。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"qwq_32b_operating_regime\",\n    \"description\": \"QwQ-32B 已有 MVP 数据的 operating regime 格式化，无新 GPU\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"c0_combined\": 0.036,\n      \"c0_aime\": 0.0,\n      \"c0_folio\": 0.0,\n      \"c0_proofwriter\": 0.1875,\n      \"sica_sc_gap_all_domains\": 0.0,\n      \"n_aime\": 22,\n      \"n_folio\": 10,\n      \"n_proofwriter\": 16,\n      \"n_total\": 48,\n      \"regime_label\": \"degenerate (C0<5%)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T1 QwQ-32B 行: AIME/FOLIO/PW 全部 SICA≡SC, C0=3.6%\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"QwQ-32B 是 negative control——论文将其呈现为 'When Does Symbolic Consensus Degenerate?'。核心 insight：reasoning model 的确定性使 symbolic consensus 冗余。这是 Claim 2 的半壁江山——C0<5% → SICA 无效，与 instruction model 的 C0>30% → SICA 有效形成对比。\\n\\n直接复用 MVP 阶段数据。QwQ-32B 的 extended chain-of-thought 使 reasoning chain 高度确定——即使在 T=0.7 下，thinking tokens 的序列长度和 internal consistency 压制了采样随机性，导致 K=12 条 trace 几乎总是收敛到同一答案。AIME/FOLIO 上 C0=0%（完全 unanimity），PW 上 18.75%（仅因三分类下偶尔在 True/Unknown 间犹豫）。SICA≡SC 是 structural 结果：无 tie 则无 tiebreaking 机会，MaxSAT 选择与 majority vote 完全一致。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"c0_diagnostic_validation\",\n    \"description\": \"跨所有模型和 K 值的 C0 vs SICA-SC gap CPU 分析\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_data_points\": 14,\n      \"c0_range_observed\": [\n        0.0,\n        0.65\n      ],\n      \"gap_range_observed\": [\n        -1.7,\n        6.6\n      ],\n      \"pearson_r\": 0.72,\n      \"spearman_rho\": 0.78,\n      \"c0_below_5pct_all_gap_zero\": true,\n      \"c0_above_20pct_positive_gap_rate\": 0.727,\n      \"binary_accuracy_20pct_threshold\": 0.86,\n      \"n_anomalous_points\": 2,\n      \"anomaly_1\": \"Mistral-7B: C0=0.35, gap=-1.7pp (low extraction quality)\",\n      \"anomaly_2\": \"PW-expanded-14B: C0=0.38, gap=0.3pp (restricted answer space)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T_diagnostic: Model × Dataset × C0 × Gap × Binary Prediction × Actual，14 行汇总\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C0 作为 binary diagnostic 在 median 档下成立（86% accuracy），但 r=0.72 不支持 continuous predictor claim。Claim 3 必须降级：'C0 serves as a binary indicator (high/low) for SICA deployment viability, rather than a continuous predictor of expected gain.' Hero figure F2 是论文最重要的图——它一眼传达 operating regime 的核心论点。\\n\\n14 个数据点来自 7 个模型配置 × 2 个主要 dataset 的组合（加上 K ablation 和 GSM8K 的少量额外点）。Pearson r=0.72 表明中等强度正相关但非完美线性——C0 是 gap 的必要非充分条件。C0<5% 的 3 个点（QwQ-32B 全域 + DeepSeek-R1 全域）全部 gap=0，验证了下界。C0>20% 的 11 个点中 8 个有正 gap，但 Mistral-7B（constraint quality 差）和 PW-expanded（answer space 受限）是异常值。Binary classification 以 C0=20% 为阈值达 86% 准确率（12/14），但这基于 14 个点——论文不应 overclaim。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_72b_awq\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit 在 D012 60 题上\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.767,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.75,\n      \"gap_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.4,\n      \"folio_sica\": 0.833,\n      \"folio_sc\": 0.8,\n      \"folio_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.717,\n      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.717,\n      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.31,\n      \"wall_time_hours\": 3.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T1 Qwen-72B 行: 76.7% vs 75.0%, +1.7pp, C0=0.40\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"72B 部分支撑 within-family scaling，但 gradient noise 限制了 Claim 3 的连续预测叙事。14B→72B 仅 13pp C0 drop 而 gap 从 3.3→1.7pp，暗示 C0-gap 关系在高 baseline 区域变弱。论文中需提及 AWQ 量化 confound。将 scaling 结果定位为 'directionally consistent' 而非 'smooth gradient'。\\n\\n72B SC baseline 更高（75% vs 14B 的 70%），反映更强模型在 NLI 上更准确。C0=0.40 与 14B 的 0.53 差异存在但不够大——这是 median 档核心特征 '72B not clearly lower than 14B'。原因：(1) 4-bit AWQ 量化引入精度损失，增加了输出随机性（部分抵消了 72B 的确定性优势）；(2) FOLIO/PW 对 72B 仍有足够挑战性（不像 GSM8K 被碾压）。Gap 缩至 1.7pp 因为高 baseline 意味着 tie 中 SC 已更常选对——SICA 的 marginal correction 空间更小。FOLIO 仍有 +3.3pp，PW 仍 0pp，pattern 不变。p=0.31 远不显著（60 题）。C0 gradient 变 noisy：7B(0.65) >> 14B(0.53) > 72B(0.40)，14B→72B 仅 drop 13pp，不是 clean monotonic decrease。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"constraint_quality_case_studies\",\n    \"description\": \"8 道代表性题目的 constraint 提取质量定性分析\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_cases\": 8,\n      \"case_selection\": \"SICA-flip-correct × 2, SICA-maintain-correct × 2, SICA-flip-wrong × 2, SICA-maintain-wrong × 2\",\n      \"constraint_semantic_accuracy\": 0.75,\n      \"categories\": {\n        \"correct_and_meaningful\": 4,\n        \"partially_correct\": 2,\n        \"noisy_but_harmless\": 1,\n        \"misleading\": 1\n      },\n      \"exclusion_justified_rate\": 0.83,\n      \"key_pattern\": \"FOLIO constraints map to premise FOL with ~80% fidelity; PW constraints degrade on multi-hop chains where intermediate steps are lossy\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"定性分析支撑 interpretability 叙事——SICA 可以展示 why（通过 constraint 权重和 exclusion），这是 SC 做不到的。但 25% 的 constraint quality issue 需在 limitations 讨论。misleading case 直接解释了为什么 tiebreak win rate 是 68% 而非 100%。\\n\\n选取 8 道覆盖 4 种 SICA 结果类型的题目做定性分析。约 75% 的 constraint 正确捕获了前提-结论关系——FOLIO 的 FOL 翻译质量较好（问题本身就是 FOL reasoning），PW 在多跳推理链上 intermediate step 的 FOL 翻译有信息损失。4 道题 constraint 完全正确且语义 meaningful（SICA flip-correct 的典型案例：多数 trace 的 constraint 一致指向正确答案，MaxSAT satisfied 它们）。2 道部分正确（关键 constraint 在但有冗余噪声 constraint）。1 道噪声但无害（constraint 全是 trivial tautology，MaxSAT 退化为 vote count）。1 道 misleading——量词范围歧义导致错误 FOL，MaxSAT 基于错误 constraint 选了错答案（SICA flip-wrong 的典型案例）。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"overhead_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"exp-001 数据的 per-question wall-time 分解\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"avg_total_per_question_s\": 56.0,\n      \"avg_generation_s\": 48.0,\n      \"avg_constraint_extraction_s\": 5.2,\n      \"avg_maxsat_solving_s\": 0.8,\n      \"avg_postprocessing_s\": 2.0,\n      \"generation_pct\": 85.7,\n      \"extraction_pct\": 9.3,\n      \"maxsat_pct\": 1.4,\n      \"postprocessing_pct\": 3.6,\n      \"overhead_vs_sc_pct\": 14.3,\n      \"overhead_vs_sc_absolute_s\": 8.0,\n      \"sc_equivalent_time_s\": 48.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T4: Stage | Time(s) | % Total — Generation 48.0(85.7%), Extraction 5.2(9.3%), MaxSAT 0.8(1.4%), Post 2.0(3.6%)\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"14% overhead 是卖点而非弱点。论文强调 'SICA adds <15% wall-time overhead to SC while providing principled tiebreaking and post-hoc constraint interpretability'。MaxSAT <1s 也反驳 over-engineering 的运行时担忧（虽然 exp-013 的 accuracy 消融可能支持简化）。\\n\\nLLM 生成（K=12 条 trace）占 86% 的时间——这部分 SICA 与 SC 完全共享，不是额外开销。Constraint extraction 需要一次额外的 LLM call（~5.2s），这是 SICA 的主要 overhead 来源。MaxSAT 在这些小规模问题（每题 ~50 个 unique constraint）上 Z3 求解极快（<1s）。总 overhead 14.3%（8s/question），全部来自 extraction + postprocessing。由于 K 次生成已经是 SC 的必要成本，SICA 的增量成本可控。对 EMNLP reviewer 的说服力：14% overhead 换取在 tie 场景下 68% vs 49% 的选择准确率，且提供 interpretable constraint analysis。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_mistral_7b\",\n    \"description\": \"Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 在 D012 60 题上的跨家族验证\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.583,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.6,\n      \"gap_pp\": -1.7,\n      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.35,\n      \"folio_sica\": 0.6,\n      \"folio_sc\": 0.633,\n      \"folio_gap_pp\": -3.3,\n      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.567,\n      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.567,\n      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.72,\n      \"c1_extraction_rate\": 0.85,\n      \"wall_time_hours\": 1.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T1 Mistral-7B 行: 58.3% vs 60.0%, -1.7pp, C0=0.35\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Mistral 的负 gap 暴露了 SICA 的隐含前提：constraint extraction quality 必须足够高。C0 是 necessary but not sufficient——高 C0 + 低 extraction quality = 负 gap。论文中将此作为 'second operating condition' 讨论：SICA 有效需要 (1) C0>20% AND (2) constraint extraction fidelity sufficient。这实际上深化了 operating regime 分析而非削弱——增加了一个维度。3-family 结果：2/3 positive (Qwen+LLaMA), 1/3 anomalous (Mistral, with identified mechanism)。\\n\\nMistral-7B 是 median 档中 'one cross-family model shows anomalous C0 or negative gap' 的体现。C0=0.35 中等（在 [0.2, 0.45] 范围内），说明 Mistral 确实有 trace diversity，按 C0 预测应有正 gap——但实际 gap 为负。根本原因：Mistral 的 instruction following 风格与 SICA 的 FOL extraction prompt 不匹配，extraction rate 仅 0.85（15% trace 提取失败）。更关键的是，成功提取的 constraint 中有相当比例存在语义错误——Mistral 的 reasoning trace 格式较 free-form，FOL 翻译的 fidelity 低于 Qwen/LLaMA。结果：噪声 constraint 误导 MaxSAT 权重分配，在 FOLIO 上 SICA 翻转了 2 道原本 SC 选对的题但只纠正了 1 道（净亏损）。PW 上 constraint 噪声被三分类的 clear majority 压制，gap=0。整体 -1.7pp 不显著（p=0.72），不能说 SICA 有害，但也不能说有益。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_llama_8b\",\n    \"description\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct 在 D012 60 题上的跨家族验证\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.617,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.6,\n      \"gap_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.43,\n      \"folio_sica\": 0.667,\n      \"folio_sc\": 0.633,\n      \"folio_gap_pp\": 3.4,\n      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.567,\n      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.567,\n      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.29,\n      \"c1_extraction_rate\": 0.94,\n      \"wall_time_hours\": 1.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T1 LLaMA-8B 行: 61.7% vs 60.0%, +1.7pp, C0=0.43\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"LLaMA 成功复制 Qwen 的 FOLIO-positive / PW-neutral pattern，消除 Qwen-specific artifact 的攻击。与 Mistral 的对比是论文的 natural experiment——控制了 model size，变化了 extraction quality，揭示 SICA 的第二个 operating condition。3-family validation: Qwen(+3.3pp) + LLaMA(+1.7pp) positive, Mistral(-1.7pp) anomalous with identified cause。\\n\\nLLaMA-3.1-8B 是 '2/3 cross-family models show expected C0 pattern' 的正面案例。C0=0.43 在 [0.2, 0.45] 范围内上段，LLaMA 8B 的 instruction following 产生中等 trace diversity。Extraction rate 0.94 接近 Qwen 水平——LLaMA 的 chat template 与 SICA extraction prompt 兼容性好（比 Mistral 好得多）。FOLIO 上 +3.4pp（1 道题的 flip），pattern 与 Qwen-14B 一致：formal logic domain + 足够 C0 + 好的 extraction quality = 正向 gap。PW 仍然 0pp（与所有 instruction model 一致）。Combined +1.7pp 在 cross_family_gap_pp [0.0, 3.0] 范围内。p=0.29 在 60 题上不显著，但方向性一致。与 Mistral 的关键对比：相似 size (7B vs 8B)，相似 C0 (0.35 vs 0.43)，截然不同的 gap (-1.7 vs +1.7)——差异在 extraction rate (0.85 vs 0.94)。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gsm8k_pilot_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B 在 GSM8K 30 题 pilot, K=12\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.9,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.9,\n      \"gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.1,\n      \"n_questions\": 30,\n      \"n_ties\": 1,\n      \"constraint_extraction_note\": \"~60% constraints are trivial arithmetic identities (e.g., x=5→x=5)\",\n      \"wall_time_hours\": 0.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Appendix T_gsm8k: 90% vs 90%, C0=10%, gap=0pp\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GSM8K null result 是 publishable insight：同一模型 14B 在 FOLIO(C0=0.48) 上 SICA 有效，在 GSM8K(C0=0.10) 上退化，证明 C0 反映 task-relative difficulty 而非 model identity。放 appendix 作 cross-domain 验证。\\n\\n14B 在 GSM8K 上极强（SC 90%），C0 仅 10%（30 题中 3 题有多候选）。GSM8K 的 grade-school 数学对 14B 是已解决任务——模型 high confidence 导致 K=12 条 trace 几乎总收敛到同一数值答案。仅 1 个 tie（3 个 multi-candidate 题中恰好 1 个 vote count 打平），SICA 无实质 tiebreaking 机会。额外挑战：数学推理的 constraint 提取语义贫乏——算术步骤 '3+4=7' 翻译为 FOL 后多是 trivial identity，无法为 MaxSAT 提供有区分力的信息。Gap=0pp 是 structural 结果。与 FOLIO(C0=0.48) 的对比说明同一模型在不同 task 上展现不同 C0——C0 是 task-relative model confidence 的反映，非 model family 固有属性。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"constraint_ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"CPU-only 消融: SICA-MaxSAT vs SICA-count-only vs SICA-random-weight 在 exp-001 的 804 题上\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_questions\": 804,\n      \"maxsat_accuracy\": 0.737,\n      \"count_only_accuracy\": 0.73,\n      \"random_weight_accuracy\": 0.72,\n      \"maxsat_vs_count_gap_pp\": 0.7,\n      \"maxsat_vs_random_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"count_vs_random_gap_pp\": 1.0,\n      \"maxsat_vs_count_bootstrap_p\": 0.33,\n      \"maxsat_vs_random_bootstrap_p\": 0.09,\n      \"tie_only_maxsat\": 0.681,\n      \"tie_only_count\": 0.638,\n      \"tie_only_random\": 0.489\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Appendix T_ablation: Method × Overall Acc × Tie-only Acc，3 行\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"消融结果迫使叙事调整。两种可选路径：(A) 'MaxSAT adds marginal accuracy but provides interpretability framework' (B) 'weighted counting suffices for accuracy; MaxSAT is the formal foundation enabling constraint-level analysis'。Median 档下选 (B)——不 overclaim MaxSAT 的 accuracy 优势，强调其作为 formal framework 的价值（constraint satisfaction/violation 的可解释性是 SC/count-only 无法提供的）。\\n\\nMedian 档定义 'MaxSAT ≥ count-only but difference small (<2pp)'。Overall：MaxSAT 73.7% vs count-only 73.0%，差 0.7pp（p=0.33 不显著）。大多数题上 MaxSAT 和 count-only 选同一答案——因为拥有更多 constraint 的答案通常也是 MaxSAT satisfiability 最高的。差异集中在 constraint 间有冲突的少数题：MaxSAT 通过 partial satisfaction 权衡冲突 constraint，而 count-only 简单加总忽略冲突。Tie-only 场景差异更大（68.1% vs 63.8%），因为 tie 正是 constraint 冲突最可能出现的地方。Random-weight 作为下界（72.0% overall, 48.9% tie-only）证明 constraint 信息本身有价值——不是随便加权就行。但 MaxSAT vs count-only 的不显著差距意味着论文不能 claim 'satisfiability checking is essential for accuracy'。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-LLaMA-8B 在 D012 60 题上验证第二个 reasoning architecture\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.683,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.683,\n      \"gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.05,\n      \"folio_sica\": 0.733,\n      \"folio_sc\": 0.733,\n      \"folio_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.65,\n      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.65,\n      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"wall_time_hours\": 1.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T1 DeepSeek-R1 行: 68.3% vs 68.3%, 0pp, C0=5%\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"两个 reasoning model（QwQ-32B Qwen底座 32B + DeepSeek-R1 LLaMA底座 8B）跨架构、跨 size 一致展示 C0<5% 且 SICA≡SC。论文可 confidently generalize：'Reasoning-trained models, regardless of base architecture or scale, exhibit trace determinism that renders symbolic consensus redundant.' 与 instruction model（高 C0）的对比构成 Claim 2 的核心 dichotomy。\\n\\nDeepSeek-R1-Distill 继承了 R1 的 reasoning training，产生 extended thinking chain 压制输出多样性。C0=5%（60 题中仅 3 题有多候选），与 QwQ-32B 的 3.6% 量级一致。虽然参数仅 8B（与 LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct 的 C0=0.43 形成鲜明对比），但 distillation training 使模型 internalize 了 step-by-step reasoning 的确定性路径。注意：R1-Distill 的 SC baseline（68.3%）比同 size 的 LLaMA-3.1-8B instruction model（60.0%）高 8pp——reasoning distillation 提升了基础准确率但消灭了 trace diversity。Gap=0pp 是 structural 的：3 个 multi-candidate 题中无 tie，MaxSAT 与 majority vote 选择一致。这完美复制了 QwQ-32B 的 pattern 但在 LLaMA 底座上——同时消除 'only QwQ' 和 'only Qwen architecture' 两重攻击。\"\n  }\n]","numLines":343,"startLine":1,"totalLines":343}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NsjBdec6cBkQggPXP6Rq6b","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CpsRazseP3jcWdyVaAXdyP","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T155754/median/paper_framing.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11308,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11308},"output_tokens":28,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c5fc2e4-30d4-41fd-873a-e3f8c4060094","uuid":"d5e1e2e2-b1e9-40ce-9833-915a188ad17a"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CpsRazseP3jcWdyVaAXdyP","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — symb_invariant_consensus\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR May 25)\n5\t- Fallback: AAAI 2027 (Aug 1)\n6\t- Deadline: May 25, 2026 (ARR submission)\n7\t\n8\t## Core Claims (3 条)\n9\t1. **Principled Tiebreaking**: SICA resolves Self-Consistency voting ties through symbolic constraint weighting, achieving higher accuracy than arbitrary tiebreak rules on logic reasoning benchmarks (FOLIO +6.7pp, combined +3.3pp on 60 questions; target: statistically significant on 200+ questions).\n10\t2. **Operating Regime Characterization**: The effectiveness of symbolic consensus is governed by trace diversity (C0), which reflects effective output diversity — SICA adds value when C0>20% (diverse outputs, disagreement to resolve) but degenerates to SC when C0<5% (converged outputs, no disagreement). C0 empirically correlates with task-relative model confidence: instruction models show high C0 on challenging tasks, reasoning models show low C0 universally. Validated across 3 model families (Qwen, Mistral, LLaMA) and 2 reasoning architectures (QwQ, DeepSeek-R1). [Note: \"C0 → epistemic uncertainty\" connection reserved for Discussion, not formal claim — reviewer risk of terminology abuse per UQ community standards.]\n11\t3. **C0 as Practical Diagnostic**: Multi-candidate rate (C0) serves as a zero-cost predictor of whether SICA deployment will yield gains over SC, enabling practitioners to decide without running full symbolic analysis.\n12\t\n13\t## Core Insight\n14\tSymbolic constraint consensus doesn't uniformly improve reasoning — it specifically helps when there IS disagreement to resolve. We provide the first systematic study of WHEN symbolic consensus adds value, revealing that trace diversity (C0) — reflecting task-relative model confidence rather than model family or task domain alone — determines the operating regime. This transforms SICA from \"yet another ensemble method\" into \"a method with formally characterizable applicability boundaries,\" validated across 3 model families and multiple reasoning domains.\n15\t\n16\t## Story Spine\n17\t- **Problem**: Self-Consistency (SC) aggregates LLM reasoning paths via majority voting but treats all chains as opaque votes, discarding the logical structure within them. When votes are tied, SC falls back to arbitrary rules (alphabetical, random) with no principled resolution.\n18\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: SC (Wang et al. 2023) — pure voting, no reasoning structure. USC (Chen et al. 2023) — universal SC, still voting-based. None exploit the formal logical structure within reasoning traces for consensus, and none characterize when symbolic methods help vs. don't.\n19\t- **Our framing**: SICA extracts first-order logic constraints from reasoning traces and uses weighted partial MAX-SAT to find the globally consistent answer. We show this provides principled tiebreaking (75%+ win rate on ties vs 25% for SC) but only when trace diversity exists. We formalize this as C0 (multi-candidate rate) — a zero-cost diagnostic reflecting effective output diversity — and validate across 3 model families (Qwen, Mistral, LLaMA), 2 reasoning architectures (QwQ, DeepSeek-R1), and multiple domains (logic, math).\n20\t- **Headline result template**: \"On FOLIO, SICA achieves 80.0% vs SC's 73.3% (+6.7pp) with Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct. On the same benchmarks with QwQ-32B, SICA degenerates to SC (C0=3.6%), revealing that symbolic consensus effectiveness is governed by trace diversity, not task difficulty.\"\n21\t\n22\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Defensive Experiments\n23\t1. **\"Gains not statistically significant\"** → exp-001: Expand to 804 questions for statistical power\n24\t2. **\"Only a better tiebreaker, not worth the overhead\"** → exp-002: K sensitivity; exp-009: overhead analysis (P1); exp-013: constraint ablation (MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight)\n25\t3. **\"Only Qwen models — family-specific artifact?\"** → exp-010: Mistral-7B + exp-011: LLaMA-8B (3-family validation)\n26\t4. **\"Only one reasoning model\"** → exp-014: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B (second reasoning architecture)\n27\t5. **\"Only logic domain — restricted answer space\"** → exp-012: GSM8K pilot with 14B (cross-domain C0 test)\n28\t6. **\"ProofWriter shows 0pp gain\"** → Domain analysis in exp-001 expanded results\n29\t7. **\"Random tiebreak baseline closes the gap\"** → exp-003: Direct SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic comparison (done on D012, will re-run on expanded)\n30\t8. **\"Why not just use a reasoning model?\"** → exp-005: QwQ-32B + exp-014: DeepSeek-R1 show reasoning models are self-consistent → SICA redundant; instruction models (cheaper, more deployed) benefit\n31\t9. **\"MAX-SAT is over-engineering\"** → exp-013: Constraint ablation proves satisfiability checking adds value over simple counting\n32\t10. **\"Within-family scaling?\"** → exp-004: 7B + exp-007: 72B-AWQ show C0 trend within Qwen family\n33\t\n34\t## Working Title\n35\t**\"When Does Symbolic Consensus Help? Characterizing the Operating Regime of Constraint-Based Reasoning Aggregation\"**\n36\t(Alternatives: \"Beyond Majority Voting: Using Trace Diversity to Predict When Symbolic Consensus Improves LLM Reasoning\")\n37\t\n38\t## Paper Structure (EMNLP 8pp + appendix)\n39\t- Main Tables: T1 (Main Results 7 models × datasets), T2 (Tiebreak Comparison), T3 (K Sensitivity), T4 (Overhead)\n40\t- Main Figures: F1 (Pipeline), F2 (C0 vs Gap Scatter — hero figure), F3 (Operating Regime Heatmap), F4 (K Curve)\n41\t- Appendix: Constraint Ablation (exp-013), Case Studies (exp-008), GSM8K (exp-012), Per-Problem Detail\n42\t\n43\t## Claim Risk Notes\n44\t- **Claim 1 make-or-break**: exp-013 constraint ablation. If MaxSAT ≈ count-only → reframe as \"principled weighting\" not \"satisfiability-based reasoning\"\n45\t- **Claim 3 downgrade risk**: If C0 has only 2 clusters (high/low) with no gradient → weaken to \"binary indicator\" not \"continuous predictor\". Gradient depends on 7B C0 >> 14B C0 >> 72B C0.\n46\t- **\"Epistemic uncertainty\" terminology**: Reserve for Discussion section only. Main text uses \"effective output diversity\" / \"task-relative model confidence\". UQ community would attack formal misuse.\n47\t\n48\t## Contingency Plan (D023)\n49\t**Trigger**: exp-001 完整结果 SICA ≤ SC（gap ≤ 0pp 或不显著）\n50\t**Strategy**: Option A (Analysis Paper) + Option C (FOLIO sub-claim if positive)\n51\t- 论文主线从\"SICA improves accuracy\"转为\"characterizing operating conditions of symbolic consensus\"\n52\t- C0 threshold pattern 成为核心贡献（\"at what C0 level does SICA begin to match/exceed SC?\")\n53\t- FOLIO 正向结果嵌入为\"domain formality → effectiveness\"子 claim\n54\t- Claim 1 弱化为\"principled + interpretable tiebreaking\"（不 claim accuracy gain）\n55\t- 需补：constraint extraction quality vs delta 相关性分析（CPU-only）\n56\t- Venue: EMNLP Main (30-35%) / Findings (60-70%) / AAAI 2027 fallback\n57\t**Decision point**: exp-001 FOLIO 70题的 C0 和 delta\n58\t\n59\t## Venue Fit Risks\n60\t- EMNLP: Contribution may feel narrow if framed as ONLY tiebreaking. Primary intellectual contribution is the \"operating regime characterization\" — the tiebreaking mechanism is evidence, not the claim.\n61\t- Cross-discipline: Combines formal logic (MAX-SAT) with NLP (LLM reasoning). MAX-SAT needs clear explanation for NLP audience.\n62\t- Negative results: QwQ-32B data must be presented as insight (\"When Does Symbolic Consensus Degenerate?\"), not failure.\n63\t- Statistical power: 60-question results are fragile. 200+ question expansion is prerequisite for credible submission.\n64\t- **[D023 新增]** If SICA ≤ SC globally: pivot to analysis paper. Must answer \"so what should practitioners do?\" → C0 as deployment diagnostic.\n65\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c5fc2e4-30d4-41fd-873a-e3f8c4060094","uuid":"85095518-b9a0-4f8c-89f4-5ca71518f759","timestamp":"2026-05-16T16:18:45.483Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T155754/median/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — symb_invariant_consensus\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR May 25)\n- Fallback: AAAI 2027 (Aug 1)\n- Deadline: May 25, 2026 (ARR submission)\n\n## Core Claims (3 条)\n1. **Principled Tiebreaking**: SICA resolves Self-Consistency voting ties through symbolic constraint weighting, achieving higher accuracy than arbitrary tiebreak rules on logic reasoning benchmarks (FOLIO +6.7pp, combined +3.3pp on 60 questions; target: statistically significant on 200+ questions).\n2. **Operating Regime Characterization**: The effectiveness of symbolic consensus is governed by trace diversity (C0), which reflects effective output diversity — SICA adds value when C0>20% (diverse outputs, disagreement to resolve) but degenerates to SC when C0<5% (converged outputs, no disagreement). C0 empirically correlates with task-relative model confidence: instruction models show high C0 on challenging tasks, reasoning models show low C0 universally. Validated across 3 model families (Qwen, Mistral, LLaMA) and 2 reasoning architectures (QwQ, DeepSeek-R1). [Note: \"C0 → epistemic uncertainty\" connection reserved for Discussion, not formal claim — reviewer risk of terminology abuse per UQ community standards.]\n3. **C0 as Practical Diagnostic**: Multi-candidate rate (C0) serves as a zero-cost predictor of whether SICA deployment will yield gains over SC, enabling practitioners to decide without running full symbolic analysis.\n\n## Core Insight\nSymbolic constraint consensus doesn't uniformly improve reasoning — it specifically helps when there IS disagreement to resolve. We provide the first systematic study of WHEN symbolic consensus adds value, revealing that trace diversity (C0) — reflecting task-relative model confidence rather than model family or task domain alone — determines the operating regime. This transforms SICA from \"yet another ensemble method\" into \"a method with formally characterizable applicability boundaries,\" validated across 3 model families and multiple reasoning domains.\n\n## Story Spine\n- **Problem**: Self-Consistency (SC) aggregates LLM reasoning paths via majority voting but treats all chains as opaque votes, discarding the logical structure within them. When votes are tied, SC falls back to arbitrary rules (alphabetical, random) with no principled resolution.\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: SC (Wang et al. 2023) — pure voting, no reasoning structure. USC (Chen et al. 2023) — universal SC, still voting-based. None exploit the formal logical structure within reasoning traces for consensus, and none characterize when symbolic methods help vs. don't.\n- **Our framing**: SICA extracts first-order logic constraints from reasoning traces and uses weighted partial MAX-SAT to find the globally consistent answer. We show this provides principled tiebreaking (75%+ win rate on ties vs 25% for SC) but only when trace diversity exists. We formalize this as C0 (multi-candidate rate) — a zero-cost diagnostic reflecting effective output diversity — and validate across 3 model families (Qwen, Mistral, LLaMA), 2 reasoning architectures (QwQ, DeepSeek-R1), and multiple domains (logic, math).\n- **Headline result template**: \"On FOLIO, SICA achieves 80.0% vs SC's 73.3% (+6.7pp) with Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct. On the same benchmarks with QwQ-32B, SICA degenerates to SC (C0=3.6%), revealing that symbolic consensus effectiveness is governed by trace diversity, not task difficulty.\"\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Defensive Experiments\n1. **\"Gains not statistically significant\"** → exp-001: Expand to 804 questions for statistical power\n2. **\"Only a better tiebreaker, not worth the overhead\"** → exp-002: K sensitivity; exp-009: overhead analysis (P1); exp-013: constraint ablation (MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight)\n3. **\"Only Qwen models — family-specific artifact?\"** → exp-010: Mistral-7B + exp-011: LLaMA-8B (3-family validation)\n4. **\"Only one reasoning model\"** → exp-014: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B (second reasoning architecture)\n5. **\"Only logic domain — restricted answer space\"** → exp-012: GSM8K pilot with 14B (cross-domain C0 test)\n6. **\"ProofWriter shows 0pp gain\"** → Domain analysis in exp-001 expanded results\n7. **\"Random tiebreak baseline closes the gap\"** → exp-003: Direct SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic comparison (done on D012, will re-run on expanded)\n8. **\"Why not just use a reasoning model?\"** → exp-005: QwQ-32B + exp-014: DeepSeek-R1 show reasoning models are self-consistent → SICA redundant; instruction models (cheaper, more deployed) benefit\n9. **\"MAX-SAT is over-engineering\"** → exp-013: Constraint ablation proves satisfiability checking adds value over simple counting\n10. **\"Within-family scaling?\"** → exp-004: 7B + exp-007: 72B-AWQ show C0 trend within Qwen family\n\n## Working Title\n**\"When Does Symbolic Consensus Help? Characterizing the Operating Regime of Constraint-Based Reasoning Aggregation\"**\n(Alternatives: \"Beyond Majority Voting: Using Trace Diversity to Predict When Symbolic Consensus Improves LLM Reasoning\")\n\n## Paper Structure (EMNLP 8pp + appendix)\n- Main Tables: T1 (Main Results 7 models × datasets), T2 (Tiebreak Comparison), T3 (K Sensitivity), T4 (Overhead)\n- Main Figures: F1 (Pipeline), F2 (C0 vs Gap Scatter — hero figure), F3 (Operating Regime Heatmap), F4 (K Curve)\n- Appendix: Constraint Ablation (exp-013), Case Studies (exp-008), GSM8K (exp-012), Per-Problem Detail\n\n## Claim Risk Notes\n- **Claim 1 make-or-break**: exp-013 constraint ablation. If MaxSAT ≈ count-only → reframe as \"principled weighting\" not \"satisfiability-based reasoning\"\n- **Claim 3 downgrade risk**: If C0 has only 2 clusters (high/low) with no gradient → weaken to \"binary indicator\" not \"continuous predictor\". Gradient depends on 7B C0 >> 14B C0 >> 72B C0.\n- **\"Epistemic uncertainty\" terminology**: Reserve for Discussion section only. Main text uses \"effective output diversity\" / \"task-relative model confidence\". UQ community would attack formal misuse.\n\n## Contingency Plan (D023)\n**Trigger**: exp-001 完整结果 SICA ≤ SC（gap ≤ 0pp 或不显著）\n**Strategy**: Option A (Analysis Paper) + Option C (FOLIO sub-claim if positive)\n- 论文主线从\"SICA improves accuracy\"转为\"characterizing operating conditions of symbolic consensus\"\n- C0 threshold pattern 成为核心贡献（\"at what C0 level does SICA begin to match/exceed SC?\")\n- FOLIO 正向结果嵌入为\"domain formality → effectiveness\"子 claim\n- Claim 1 弱化为\"principled + interpretable tiebreaking\"（不 claim accuracy gain）\n- 需补：constraint extraction quality vs delta 相关性分析（CPU-only）\n- Venue: EMNLP Main (30-35%) / Findings (60-70%) / AAAI 2027 fallback\n**Decision point**: exp-001 FOLIO 70题的 C0 和 delta\n\n## Venue Fit Risks\n- EMNLP: Contribution may feel narrow if framed as ONLY tiebreaking. Primary intellectual contribution is the \"operating regime characterization\" — the tiebreaking mechanism is evidence, not the claim.\n- Cross-discipline: Combines formal logic (MAX-SAT) with NLP (LLM reasoning). MAX-SAT needs clear explanation for NLP audience.\n- Negative results: QwQ-32B data must be presented as insight (\"When Does Symbolic Consensus Degenerate?\"), not failure.\n- Statistical power: 60-question results are fragile. 200+ question expansion is prerequisite for credible submission.\n- **[D023 新增]** If SICA ≤ SC globally: pivot to analysis paper. Must answer \"so what should practitioners do?\" → C0 as deployment diagnostic.\n","numLines":65,"startLine":1,"totalLines":65}}}
